1
00:00:00,669 --> 00:00:02,439
(Sheldon:)This rock

2
00:00:02,438 --> 00:00:05,408
(Sheldon:)encapsulates
all my negative emotions.

3
00:00:06,208 --> 00:00:09,578
(Sheldon:)I will cast you far away.

4
00:00:09,578 --> 00:00:12,108
(Sheldon:)Feel free to take out a pigeon
while you're at it.

5
00:00:13,616 --> 00:00:15,746
(Leonard:)Let it fly.

6
00:00:17,653 --> 00:00:19,853
(Sheldon:)Ow, ow, ow, ow,

7
00:00:19,855 --> 00:00:22,355
(Sheldon:)ow, ow, ow, ow...

8
00:00:23,525 --> 00:00:25,195
(Amy:)What happened?

9
00:00:25,194 --> 00:00:26,894
(Sheldon:)I tried to let go of anger

10
00:00:26,895 --> 00:00:29,425
(Sheldon:)and threw a rock
into my foot!

11
00:00:30,399 --> 00:00:32,529
(Leonard:)Then he got more angry
and kicked the rock

12
00:00:32,534 --> 00:00:34,204
(Leonard:)with his other foot.
Wha--?

13
00:00:34,203 --> 00:00:35,803
(Penny:)And what happened to you?

14
00:00:35,804 --> 00:00:37,104
(Leonard:)Oh, I laughed so hard,

15
00:00:37,106 --> 00:00:38,876
(Leonard:)I burst a blood vessel
in my nose. It's fine.

16
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:51,260
(Amy:)You know, it's one thing
to be envious,

17
00:00:51,262 --> 00:00:52,792
(Amy:)but now you're
injuring yourself.

18
00:00:52,797 --> 00:00:54,697
(Amy:)It has to stop.

19
00:00:54,699 --> 00:00:55,929
(Leonard:)Although if you are
gonna do it again,

20
00:00:55,934 --> 00:00:59,024
(Leonard:)please let me know,
so I can get it on video.

